OL,3,GNEWSASamaritans confirms closure of
OL,4,Abranches in north of Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamaritans has confirmed the closure of
OL,7,Ffour of its branches in Scotland.
OL,9,FThe sites in Stornoway, Thurso, Orkney
OL,10,Fand Shetland are to shut as part of
OL,11,Fwider changes to the suicide prevention
OL,12,Fcharity's UK operations.
OL,14,FIts branch in Elgin is to be merged
OL,15,Fwith Inverness.
OL,17,FNeil Mathers, executive director for
OL,18,FScotland, said the charity was moving
OL,19,Fto fewer, larger branches to
OL,20,F"strengthen volunteer capacity and
OL,21,Fprovide more reliable support".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
